{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Luckily, they bred once or twice and raised the little ones. Hey, lots of people raise these fish at home to sell."}],"id":"58e00d8d25282b1c","jyutping":"hou2 coi2 dou1 saang1 dou2 dou1 saang1 dou2 jat1 loeng5 ci3 dou1 joeng5 daai6 go2 di1 sai3 ge3 hei3 hou2 do1 jan4 hai2 uk1 kei2 joeng5 ni1 di1 jyu2 ling1 ceot1 lai4 maai6 gaa3","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"（好彩）都生到，都生到一、兩次。都養大嗰啲細嘅。嘿，好多人喺屋企養哩啲魚拎出來賣𡃉。","words":[{"jyutping":"hou2 coi2","pos":"a","text":"好彩"},{"jyutping":"dou1","pos":"d","text":"都"},{"jyutping":"saang1","pos":"v","text":"生"},{"jyutping":"dou2","pos":"u","text":"到"},{"jyutping":"dou1","pos":"d","text":"都"},{"jyutping":"saang1","pos":"v","text":"生"},{"jyutping":"dou2","pos":"u","text":"到"},{"jyutping":"jat1","pos":"m","text":"一"},{"jyutping":"loeng5","pos":"m","text":"兩"},{"jyutping":"ci3","pos":"q","text":"次"},{"jyutping":"dou1","pos":"d","text":"都"},{"jyutping":"joeng5 daai6","pos":"v","text":"養大"},{"jyutping":"go2 di1","pos":"r","text":"嗰啲"},{"jyutping":"sai3","pos":"a","text":"細"},{"jyutping":"ge3","pos":"u","text":"嘅"},{"jyutping":"hei3","pos":"e","text":"嘿"},{"jyutping":"hou2 do1","pos":"m","text":"好多"},{"jyutping":"jan4","pos":"n","text":"人"},{"jyutping":"hai2","pos":"p","text":"喺"},{"jyutping":"uk1 kei2","pos":"n","text":"屋企"},{"jyutping":"joeng5","pos":"v","text":"養"},{"jyutping":"ni1 di1","pos":"r","text":"哩啲"},{"jyutping":"jyu2","pos":"n","text":"魚"},{"jyutping":"ling1","pos":"v","text":"拎"},{"jyutping":"ceot1 lai4","pos":"v","text":"出來"},{"jyutping":"maai6","pos":"v","text":"賣"},{"jyutping":"gaa3","pos":"y","text":"𡃉"}]}
{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Yeah, it’s really not worth it, so I’m willing to give it up too."}],"id":"6643ec8faf495068","jyutping":"hai6 aak3 hou2 m4 dai2 lo1 so2 ji5 ngo5 dou1 se2 dak1 ge2","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"係呃，好唔抵囖，所以我都捨得𠸏。","words":[{"jyutping":"hai6","pos":"v","text":"係"},{"jyutping":"aak3","pos":"y","text":"呃"},{"jyutping":"hou2","pos":"d","text":"好"},{"jyutping":"m4","pos":"d","text":"唔"},{"jyutping":"dai2","pos":"a","text":"抵"},{"jyutping":"lo1","pos":"y","text":"囖"},{"jyutping":"so2 ji5","pos":"c","text":"所以"},{"jyutping":"ngo5","pos":"r","text":"我"},{"jyutping":"dou1","pos":"d","text":"都"},{"jyutping":"se2 dak1","pos":"v","text":"捨得"},{"jyutping":"ge2","pos":"y","text":"𠸏"}]}
{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Would it be like, uh, grabbing your leg and then giving it a hard stab?"}],"id":"7ea9b1603770a0f8","jyutping":"keoi5 wui5 m4 wui5 ne1 zik1 hai6 hou2 ci5 zik1 hai6 e6 laai1 zyu6 nei5 zek3 goek3 jin4 hau6 daai6 lik6 jat1 cok3 go2 zek3","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"佢會唔會呢即係好似即係，誒，拉住你隻腳，然後大力一剒嗰隻？","words":[{"jyutping":"keoi5","pos":"r","text":"佢"},{"jyutping":"wui5","pos":"vu","text":"會"},{"jyutping":"m4","pos":"d","text":"唔"},{"jyutping":"wui5","pos":"vu","text":"會"},{"jyutping":"ne1","pos":"y1","text":"呢"},{"jyutping":"zik1 hai6","pos":"c","text":"即係"},{"jyutping":"hou2 ci5","pos":"v","text":"好似"},{"jyutping":"zik1 hai6","pos":"c","text":"即係"},{"jyutping":"e6","pos":"e","text":"誒"},{"jyutping":"laai1","pos":"v","text":"拉"},{"jyutping":"zyu6","pos":"u","text":"住"},{"jyutping":"nei5","pos":"r","text":"你"},{"jyutping":"zek3","pos":"q","text":"隻"},{"jyutping":"goek3","pos":"n","text":"腳"},{"jyutping":"jin4 hau6","pos":"c","text":"然後"},{"jyutping":"daai6 lik6","pos":"a","text":"大力"},{"jyutping":"jat1","pos":"m","text":"一"},{"jyutping":"cok3","pos":"v","text":"剒"},{"jyutping":"go2","pos":"r","text":"嗰"},{"jyutping":"zek3","pos":"q","text":"隻"}]}
